{"type": "response.output_text.delta", "item_id": "msg_1", "output_index": 0, "content_index": 0, "delta": "Here is a dashboard drawn from HTML and CSS:\n\n```view\n<div style=\"width:640px;font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#e8e8f0\">\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5b5bf7 0%,#a24ee0 55%,#e0559b 100%);border-radius:14px 14px 0 0;padding:14px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.85\">ether \u00b7 generative view</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#fff\">Workspace health</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px\">\n      <span style=\"background:#ffffff26;border-radius:999px;padding:3px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#fff\">\u25cf build passing</span>\n      <span style=\"background:#ffffff26;border-radius:999px;padding:3px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#fff\">\u25cf clippy clean</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff0a;border:1px solid #ffffff1c;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 14px 14px;padding:18px 20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n    <svg width=\"150\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"0 0 42 42\">\n      <defs><linearGradient id=\"g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#4cd9a0\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#3aa0ff\"/></linearGradient></defs>\n      <circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"21\" r=\"15.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff1f\" stroke-width=\"4.5\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"21\" r=\"15.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#g)\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"94 6\" stroke-dashoffset=\"25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n      <text x=\"21\" y=\"22.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">94%</text>\n      <text x=\"21\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"2.3\" fill=\"#aab\">prompt cache hits</text>\n    </svg>\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#9a9ab0;margin-bottom:8px\">Rust lines per crate</div>\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:62px 1fr 52px;gap:7px 10px;align-items:center;font-size:13px\">\n        <span>tui</span><div style=\"background:#ffffff14;border-radius:5px;height:12px\"><div style=\"width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5b5bf7,#e0559b)\"></div></div><span style=\"text-align:right\">34.6k</span>\n        <span>engine</span><div style=\"background:#ffffff14;border-radius:5px;height:12px\"><div style=\"width:22%;height:100%;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5b5bf7,#a24ee0)\"></div></div><span style=\"text-align:right\">7.7k</span>\n        <span>llm</span><div style=\"background:#ffffff14;border-radius:5px;height:12px\"><div style=\"width:5.4%;height:100%;border-radius:5px;background:#5b5bf7\"></div></div><span style=\"text-align:right\">1.9k</span>\n        <span>ui-spec</span><div style=\"background:#ffffff14;border-radius:5px;height:12px\"><div style=\"width:1.2%;min-width:4px;height:100%;border-radius:5px;background:#5b5bf7\"></div></div><span style=\"text-align:right\">0.2k</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#9a9ab0\">\n        <span>tokens per turn</span>\n        <svg width=\"220\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 34\">\n          <polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4cd9a0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"0,28 22,24 44,26 66,18 88,20 110,12 132,15 154,9 176,11 198,5 220,7\"/>\n          <polyline fill=\"#4cd9a022\" stroke=\"none\" points=\"0,34 0,28 22,24 44,26 66,18 88,20 110,12 132,15 154,9 176,11 198,5 220,7 220,34\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span style=\"color:#e8e8f0\">7.1k</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\nEverything above is static HTML, CSS and inline SVG."}
